      "key": {"correct_choice_id": "c"},
      "explanation_md": "El denominador se anula en $x=-2$."
    },
    {
      "id": "m04l02-x2", "kind": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": 1, "skill_ids": ["function_domain"],
      "prompt_md": "¿Cuál es el dominio de $f(x)=\\sqrt{2x-8}$?",
      "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "$(4,+\\infty)$"}, {"id": "b", "text": "$[4,+\\infty)$"}, {"id": "c", "text": "$[-4,+\\infty)$"}, {"id": "d", "text": "$\\mathbb R$"}],
      "key": {"correct_choice_id": "b"},
      "explanation_md": "$2x-8\\ge0$ → $x\\ge4$; el 4 está incluido porque $\\sqrt0=0$."
    },
    {
      "id": "m04l02-x3", "kind": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": 2, "skill_ids": ["function_domain"],
      "prompt_md": "¿Cuál es el dominio de $f(x)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{x-1}$?",
      "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "$[0,+\\infty)$"}, {"id": "b", "text": "$\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{1\\}$"}, {"id": "c", "text": "$[0,1)\\cup(1,+\\infty)$"}, {"id": "d", "text": "$(0,1)\\cup(1,+\\infty)$"}],
      "key": {"correct_choice_id": "c"},
      "explanation_md": "Raíz: $x\\ge0$. Denominador: $x\\neq1$. Intersección: $[0,1)\\cup(1,+\\infty)$."
